{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>Fathers shall not be put to death for children.</b> On the testimony of children, and likewise children on the testimony of fathers. And it mentioned 'fathers' and 'children,' and the same rule applies to all relatives who are disqualified from testifying — and it is a scriptural decree that they are disqualified for everything, even to their detriment, no need to say to their vindication and to their benefit."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:50:51.142631980Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}